   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "In-service aboveground storage tank inspection and integrity practice context. Applicability is tank-specific (API 650/12C-constructed tanks) and jurisdiction-dependent; the enterprise's engineering standards and governing regulations control; not for underground tanks, pipeline integrity, metering methodology, capital decision rights, or asset-management ownership; standard text is purchase access - claims based on public API materials. Evidence only, not text to copy."
   }
