    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "PCI DSS payment-card security scope and control context for card-program processes that store, process, transmit, or can affect the security of applicable payment-card account data. Applicability is fact-dependent and must be determined by Security with relevant business, technology, processor, acquirer, Treasury, and legal owners. Closed-loop/proprietary card programs may have different scope depending on architecture and data handling. The source does not determine internal process ownership, card-program design, fraud liability, payment settlement, or legal compliance conclusions."
